538
00:34:42.560 --> 00:34:45.760
Mina pole, olen ju terve
ja energiline noormees,

539
00:34:45.860 --> 00:34:50.150
siin pole tõepoolest midagi teha.
Tingimised on kitsad, inimesed,

540
00:34:50.150 --> 00:34:53.375
